{"id":"abschied","lemma":"Abschied","pos":"noun","rank":2659,"glosses":["parting, farewell"],"ipa":"/ˈapˌʃiːt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/98/De-Abschied.ogg/De-Abschied.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Abschiedes","plural":"Abschiede"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich hasse lange Abschiede.","en":"I hate long goodbyes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate","l":"hassen"},{"g":"long, for a long time"},null]},{"text":"Ich schätze, das ist der Abschied.","en":"I guess this is goodbye.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to estimate","l":"schätzen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich mag Abschiede nicht.","en":"I don't like goodbyes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},null,{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Abschiede sind immer traurig.","en":"Goodbyes are always sad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/665","words":[null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"sadly"}]},{"text":"Sie winkte mir zum Abschied.","en":"She waved goodbye to me.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to wave one's hand","l":"winken"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to the"},null]}]}